  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2733,
      "text": "and those who do whatever [good] they do with their hearts fearful[27], knowing that they will return to their Lord –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2734,
      "text": "it is they who hasten to do good deeds, and they are foremost in them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2735,
      "text": "We do not burden a soul more than what it can bear. We have a Record [of their deeds][28] that tells the truth, and none will be wronged[29].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2736,
      "text": "But their hearts are oblivious to this[30], and they have other [evil] deeds that they are doing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2737,
      "text": "But as soon as We seize their affluent ones with punishment[31], they start crying for help.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2738,
      "text": "“Do not cry for help today, for you will receive no help from Us.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2739,
      "text": "My verses were recited to you, but you used to turn back on your heels,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2740,
      "text": "feeling proud of this [Sacred House], spending night in evil talks [about the Qur’an].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2741,
      "text": "Have they not pondered the Words [of Allah], or has there come to them what did not come to their forefathers?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2742,
      "text": "Or is it that they do not recognize their Messenger, so they deny him?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2743,
      "text": "Or do they say, “There is madness in him?” Rather, he has come to them with the truth, but most of them are averse to the truth.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2744,
      "text": "Were the Truth to follow their desires, the heavens and earth, and all those who are therein would have been ruined. In fact, We have given them their Reminder, but they are averse to their Reminder.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2745,
      "text": "Or do you ask them for some reward[32]? But the reward of your Lord is best[33], and He is the Best of Providers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2746,
      "text": "Indeed, you are calling them to a straight path,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2747,
      "text": "but those who do not believe in the Hereafter are deviating from that path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 346,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
